# Full flavor = packages-base.list + this file.
# Extra packages for observability and opt-in features. All come from the
# official precompiled 25.12.2 feeds (no source compilation, no host Go).
#
# Runtime tuning is NOT a package matter: first-boot UCI defaults live in
# files/etc/uci-defaults/99-redmi-ac2100-tuning (see docs/performance.md).

# --- Observability / benchmarking (justified in docs/benchmarks.md) ---
iperf3
tcpdump-mini
ethtool
conntrack
htop

# --- Optional features (installed, never auto-configured) ---
# tailscale: service not started, no auth key in the image (docs/tailscale.md).
tailscale
# smartdns + LuCI app: dnsmasq remains the LAN resolver until you opt in
# (docs/performance.md).
smartdns
luci-app-smartdns

# Deliberately NOT included (evaluated, rejected; see docs/performance.md):
#   SQM / kmod-sched-cake / luci-app-sqm - conflicts with the hw-offload fast path
#   irqbalance                           - no MT7621-specific evidence; measure first
#   samba4 / minidlna / usb-storage      - out of scope for a lean router
#   wpad-full / hostapd extras           - basic-mbedtls variant is sufficient
